# state_values,...row_major_grid]
# Output: [...9_next_state_values,visual_x,visual_y,steps_started,tiles_arrived,blocked_flag]
# Persistent one-update controller. Directions 0=release,1=up,2=right,3=down,4=left (Y down).
# State: tile_x,tile_y,target_x,target_y,progress,buffered_direction,held_direction,repeat_remaini
# ng,buffer_remaining. Keep the first nine outputs for the next call. Zero tiles are walkable. dt
# is 0..1 seconds; repeat delay/interval >=0.01 seconds. See README for event ordering and static-
# map assumptions; [-1] means invalid configuration/state.
# Precondition: finite, correctly shaped data; integer indices/counts/IDs.
